# The top folder's .gitignore (copy it to .gitignore there, bench/README.md).
# Everything is ignored unless listed: a game, a disc image or a recording
# cannot come in by accident. Name what the top folder keeps below: the
# notes, Claude's settings, the ledger and the folders backup.sh mirrors in.
# Never the bench folder or another folder that is its own repository: git
# would record only a bare link to it.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/.bench-allow
!/method.local.toml
# !/<the notes folder>/
# !/.claude/
# !/ledger/
# !/mirror/

# Inside them, never: build outputs (they come back from the sources),
# recordings and images (kept on the bench, backed up apart).
build/
build_*/
*.lst
*.wav
*.flac
*.m4a
*.raw
*.img
*.vhd
*.86f
*.pak
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.swp
backup.log
